<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-DEWULF IN FRENCH OPEN SEMI FINALS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DEWULF IN FRENCH OPEN SEMI FINALS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results on the ninth</p>
<p>day of the French Open tennis tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Quarter-finals: Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat Magnus Norman</p>
<p>(Sweden) 6-2 6-7 (2-7) 6-4 6-3</p>
